{"id":"633093","name":"山药奶香馒头","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/633093/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"中筋面粉","amount":"300克"},{"name":"山药泥","amount":"200克"},{"name":"纯牛奶","amount":"50克"},{"name":"糖","amount":"30克"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"3克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好山药。","img":"images/633093/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去皮，切成薄片。","img":"images/633093/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"上锅隔水蒸熟(20分钟左右)。","img":"images/633093/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入料理机，打成泥。","img":"images/633093/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"取300克面粉。","img":"images/633093/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入山药泥、纯牛奶、酵母、糖。","img":"images/633093/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌成大棉絮。","img":"images/633093/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"揉成光滑的面团，盖上保鲜膜，放入温暖处醒发至两倍大。","img":"images/633093/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"发酵好的面团。","img":"images/633093/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"分成8个均匀的小剂子。","img":"images/633093/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"取出一个小面团，再次排气，揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/633093/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"搓成稍高的馒头形状。","img":"images/633093/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"依次全部做完，冷水上锅，放入蒸锅中，再次醒发20分钟。","img":"images/633093/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"开大火，出气后，蒸15分钟，关火后再虚蒸3~5分钟。","img":"images/633093/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/633093/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/633093/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}